{"step_index":73,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:56:39Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T16:56:39+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 92752dbc-e919-4b9e-b022-202726747cbe/task-73\nTask Description: /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport networkx as nx\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import milp, LinearConstraint, Bounds\nimport random\n\ndef roman_domination(G):\n    n = G.number_of_nodes()\n    nodes = list(G.nodes())\n    node_idx = {v: i for i, v in enumerate(nodes)}\n    c = np.array([1]*n + [2]*n, dtype=float)\n    integrality = np.ones(2*n)\n    A_rows = []\n    lhs = []\n    rhs = []\n    for i, v in enumerate(nodes):\n        row1 = [0]*(2*n)\n        row1[i] = 1\n        row1[n + i] = 1\n        A_rows.append(row1)\n        lhs.append(0)\n        rhs.append(1)\n        \n        row2 = [0]*(2*n)\n        row2[i] = 1\n        row2[n + i] = 1\n        for u in G.neighbors(v):\n            row2[n + node_idx[u]] = 1\n        A_rows.append(row2)\n        lhs.append(1)\n        rhs.append(np.inf)\n        \n    constraints = LinearConstraint(A_rows, lhs, rhs)\n    bounds = Bounds(0, 1)\n    res = milp(c=c, integrality=integrality, constraints=constraints, bounds=bounds)\n    return int(round(res.fun))\n\n# Local search to maximize r + 1 - rd\nfound = False\nfor n in [6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12]:\n    for restart in range(10):\n        # start with a random tree or path\n        G = nx.path_graph(n)\n        for step in range(50):\n            r = nx.radius(G)\n            rd = roman_domination(G)\n            diff = (r + 1) - rd\n            if diff > 0:\n                print(f'FOUND COUNTEREXAMPLE! n={n}, diff={diff}, edges={list(G.edges())}')\n                found = True\n                break\n            # mutate: add or remove an edge\n            u, v = random.sample(range(n), 2)\n            if G.has_edge(u, v):\n                if G.degree(u) > 1 and G.degree(v) > 1:\n                    G.remove_edge(u, v)\n                    if not nx.is_connected(G):\n                        G.add_edge(u, v)\n            else:\n                G.add_edge(u, v)\n        if found:\n            break\n    if found:\n        break\nif not found:\n    print('No counterexample found by local search!')\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/92752dbc-e919-4b9e-b022-202726747cbe/.system_generated/tasks/task-73.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
